  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 5th level, you've developed a masterful command over chemicals, enhancing the healing and damage you create through them. Whenever you use a creation using your alchemist's supplies as the creation focus, you gain a bonus to one roll of the creation. That roll must restore hit points or be a damage roll that deals acid, fire, necrotic, or poison damage, and the bonus equals your Intelligence modifier (minimum of +1).</p>",
